---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import speakingImage from '../assets/people/joy-speaking.jpg';
import { organizationSchema, serviceSchema } from '../data/schema';
---
<BaseLayout title="Public Speaking & Preaching | Threads Coaching" description="Speaking and preaching that connects inspiration, faith and practical action for churches, events and teams." path="/public-speaking" schema={[organizationSchema, serviceSchema('Public speaking and preaching', '/public-speaking', 'Speaking and preaching that connects inspiration, faith and practical action for churches, events and teams.')] }>
  <div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Speaking and preaching' }]} /></div><section class="hero-copy section"><div class="container split split--media"><div><p class="eyebrow">Speaking and preaching</p><h1>Need a communicator who can move people from inspiration to action?</h1><p class="lead">We believe communication can do more than fill a programme slot. Joy is an experienced communicator who regularly speaks to groups ranging from small gatherings to audiences in the thousands.</p><a class="button" href="/contact">Enquire about speaking</a></div><Image src={speakingImage} alt="Joy speaking to an audience" width={640} densities={[1, 1.5]} sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 45vw, 100vw" quality={58} /></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Scripture, applied Christian teaching and an invitation towards meaningful change.</h2><p>Joy draws from Scripture and applied Christian teaching to mobilise people towards mission and meaningful change. For events, podcasts, conferences or discussion panels, tell us what you want your audience to think, feel and do differently.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>Formats</h2><div class="three-up"><p><strong>Church services and gatherings</strong><br />Preaching and teaching that helps people connect faith with everyday life.</p><p><strong>Events and conferences</strong><br />A thoughtful contribution to conversations about leadership, change and purpose.</p><p><strong>Podcasts and panels</strong><br />Warm, grounded discussion that brings useful perspective to the room.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>A straightforward way to enquire</h2><ol class="steps"><li><strong>Share the event.</strong><span>Tell us about your audience, setting and hoped-for outcome.</span></li><li><strong>Explore the fit.</strong><span>Discuss a relevant theme and practical requirements.</span></li><li><strong>Plan with confidence.</strong><span>Agree the next step together.</span></li></ol><p>For team-focused facilitation as well as speaking, explore <a href="/team-workshops">teams and workshops</a>.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Planning questions</h2><details><summary>Can the message be shaped around our audience?</summary><p>Yes. An initial conversation helps clarify the setting, audience and the outcome you hope for.</p></details><details><summary>Is speaking available beyond church settings?</summary><p>Yes. Joy can discuss relevant formats for events, conferences, podcasts and panels.</p></details></div></section>
  <CallToAction title="Looking for a thoughtful voice for your next event?" body="Start with a conversation about your audience and event." primaryHref="/contact" primaryLabel="Enquire about speaking" />
</BaseLayout>
